          "version": "1.0.1",
          "description": "Added config support. You can now set the multiplier used for bot health.\nThe default config uses a 1x multiplier and the behaviour will be the same as version 1.0.0\n\n- Example 1\n  - Player Stomach = 70HP\n  - Boss Stomach = 200HP\n  - Multiplier = 2.0\n  - Boss Stomach after mod ajustments = 140HP (70 x 2)\n\n- Example 2\n  - Player Stomach = 70HP\n  - Boss Stomach = 200HP\n  - Multiplier = 0.5\n  - Boss Stomach after mod ajustments = 35HP (70 x 0.5)\n\n- Example 3\n  - Player Stomach = 70HP\n  - Random bot Stomach = 60HP\n  - Multiplier = 1.0\n  - Boss Stomach after mod ajustments = 60HP (unchanged because it is lower than Player Stomach * multiplier)",
